{"title":"College resources","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>This page is a resources guide for students interested in colleges and universities.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Information_About_Colleges_and_Universities\">Information About Colleges and Universities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=College_resources&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Information About Colleges and Universities\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.collegesource.org/home.asp\">Online catalogues for colleges and universities</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Elite_Universities\">Elite Universities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=College_resources&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Elite Universities\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Elite_university\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Elite university\">U.S. elite universities</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=College_resources&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c172\">College Forum on AoPS</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.collegeboard.com\">College Board homepage</a> (SAT information and other resources)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.collegeconfidential.com\">College Confidential</a> includes an active forum.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_Colleges_and_Universities\" title=\"List of United States Colleges and Universities\">List of United States Colleges and Universities</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_scholarships\" title=\"Academic scholarships\">Academic scholarships</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018080702\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.009 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 11/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:1916:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018080702 and revision id 244336. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}